<title>JAPAN: Chuetsu Co - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chuetsu Co - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.18		vs	    7.37</p>
<p> Operating	   55    million    vs	   50    million</p>
<p> Current	     61    million    vs	   58    million</p>
<p> Net		   25    million    vs	   25    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.19 yen	  vs	    1.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  1.50 yen	  vs	    1.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chuetsu Co Ltd is a medium-size paper manufacturer.</p>
</text>
